  "ingredients": [
    "2 pastries for 9-inch single crust pies",
    "3 cups diced Granny Smith apple",
    "2 tablespoons instant tapioca",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "lemon juice",
    "0.125 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut four 6-inch rounds out of the pie crusts, and fit them into four 5-inch mini pie dishes. Cut remaining pie crust into 1/8-inch strips, and set dough aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H6lK9bYJcCKznHirIPnUxm5ABes=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219617-mini-apple-pies-DDMFS-step-01-d28f31ef12f549fdacfefcc248e9ad06.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219617/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix diced apple, tapioca, sugar, lemon juice, nutmeg, and cinnamon in a bowl until thoroughly combined; allow mixture to stand for 5 minutes to soften the tapioca. Stir mixture again, and spoon into prepared pie shells. Use the strips of dough to weave a small lattice crust on top of each pie, and pinch the strips onto the bottom crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oJtu0bRcBbYKyupLwzbT5qVqpRU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219617-mini-apple-pies-DDMFS-step-02-f8eed1d638614d12b4cd896ad5dc177a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219617/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the pies are golden brown and apple filling is bubbling, about 30 minutes. Cool before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dtl6eMmokQtOsiYYfEJbc6A0nhI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219617-mini-apple-pies-DDMFS-step-03-84f3bd8df7db4bd0b5e373b4debf10e0.jpg"
      ],
